request.description:
Paginated transaction history for the authenticated user.

Response 200: Page<TransactionResponse> {
  content: [TransactionResponse], totalElements, totalPages, number, size
}

Get a specific transaction by ID. User must own the transaction.

Response 200: TransactionResponse {
  transactionId, status, amount, currency, transactionType,
  description, initiatedAt, completedAt, failureReason
}

Get current transaction status for saga recovery.

Response 200: {
  transactionId, status, sagaId, sagaStep, initiatedAt, isTerminal: boolean
}
